    <id>announcementbanner</id>
    <name>Announcement Banner</name>
    <summary>Display and schedule customizable notification bars on every Nextcloud page.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Post an announcement banner across every Nextcloud page to keep everyone informed.


**Features**
 * Multiple banners with overview, status, and edit/delete actions.
 * Global banners visible on all pages with themed variants (info, success, warning, danger, custom).
 * Optional schedule with start/end times to control when banners are visible.
 * Optional dismiss button so users can hide the banner when allowed.
 * Optional "read more" link with custom label and URL.
 * Optional translations for banner message and read-more label (fallback to default).
 * Live preview in admin settings before publishing to everyone.
 * Changes take effect immediately after saving.]]></description>
